# All entries below are placeholder / example values in tests, docs, or UI fixtures.
# None are real credentials. Format: one fingerprint per line (commit:file:rule:line).
# Every fingerprint needs its own "# Reviewed <date> by <who>: <reason>" line directly above it
# (nself-ci gate gitleaksignore-reviewed); add new ones with `cam ci ignore-add`.
