# .gitleaks.toml already allowlists these paths/values, but .github/gitleaks.toml (Gitleaks workflow,
# lefthook pre-commit) does not, so the fingerprints stay. Stale entries for commit cadfc1d2 (a prettier
# reformat commit on no branch, never scanned) were dropped 2026-10-11 (D-0410).
# See .github/wiki/architecture/auth-bypass-fix.md for audit trail.

